    <expires>2025-09-09T14:00:00+02:00</expires>
    <senderName>LU</senderName>
    <headline>Floods in the north of Luxembourg</headline>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: black;"&gt;The north of Luxembourg has been placed under awareness level yellow floods from 08.09.2025 17:30 to 09.09.2025 14:00. The awareness level can be adapted or extended depending on the evolution of the situation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: black;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: black;"&gt;Due to the uncertain localization of precipitation, increased caution is advised near small water bodies and in frequently affected areas, especially during seasonal activities along rivers and streams (such as camping sites, construction sites, etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: black;"&gt;According to current predictions, elevated water levels are also forecasted at the Diekirch gauge. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please take precautions and inform yourself on the right behaviour to adopt.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For further information, measured and forecasted water levels, please visit the &amp;#39;inondations.lu&amp;#39; website and follow attentively the information provided in the eventually published flood reports.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    <parameter>
